<title>USA: Blount raises class B div to $0.1182/shr.</title>
<headline>Blount raises class B div to $0.1182/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blount International Inc said Monday it increased its annual dividend rate for the class B stock from $0.4067 to $0.4728 per share.</p>
<p>The increased dividend will be payable January 2 to shareholders of record on December 13, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
